comment.narrative:
This indicator will aim to measure improvements in the quality of people&#39;s lives in terms of time saving, safety or income, due to safe water usage, and was to be determined based on surveys conducted in 4 to 6 pilot sites.

MTR assessment

The 24x7 water supply services under the project have not yet been delivered. The community feedback will be taken once the services improve. The target will remain unchanged.&nbsp;

Beneficiary feedback indicator&nbsp;

The mission informed the PMU and MISE that the World Bank projects are supposed to report on the Beneficiary Feedback indicator, at the latest, by the end of 3rd year of implementation. There should be credible progress shown from the base line.

Since there is no data update so far, PMU is supposed to give a time frame by which data will be availale, and actions being taken.

PMU agreed to initiate a resurvey, on a sample basis, through the BCC consultant, to update the baseline.&nbsp;

