This indicator describes the number of people who have taken part in improved hygiene behavior or sanitation practices training under the project. This includes beneficiaries of face-to-face training, workshops, community consultations implemented as part of WASH awareness campaigns, and of the Sanitation Pilots component.

MTR assessment

About 3000 people have already been reached though the consultant recruited for WaSH awareness raising.&nbsp;

The consultant will provide gender disaggregated data to enable updates to the sub-indicator related to female.&nbsp;

