Total annual operational revenues (generated by water sales) / total annual operating costs (without depreciation).

MTR assessment

This indicator will be dropped and integrated with the previous indicator, once redefined.&nbsp;

Total annual operational revenues (generated by water sales) / total annual operating costs (without depreciation).

MTR assessment

This indicator will be dropped and integrated with the previous indicator, once redefined.&nbsp;

Ratio between operational and maintenance costs (without depreciation) and volumes of water sold over one year.

MTR assessment

There is no fee being collected as of now.&nbsp;

The MTR mission assessed that the definition of this indicator is unclear - the O&amp;M costs can&#39;t be only at 30% level of water sales; also it can not be &quot;volume&quot; of water sold, it has to be value of sales.

Hence a standard indicator to measure the utility performance on cost efficiencies will be defined as part of restructuring. Options will be discussed during the O&amp;M workshop.&nbsp;&nbsp;

