Time spent daily, on average, by South Tarawa households collecting water for their residential use: going to the point source, waiting in line, fetching water and returning&nbsp;home.

There is no data available as of yet.&nbsp;

MTR Assessment&nbsp;

With every household connected through house connection / provided with a connection near by, it is expected that time spent by the household in collecting water will drastically reduce. The target is retained.&nbsp;

PMU will update the baseline through a fresh baseline survey.&nbsp;

