NRW is defined as the percentage of water produced that is not ultimately billed to consumers. Water not billed to consumers results from water losses (physical and commercial losses) as well as authorized consumption that is not billed. This will be calculated with the IWA methodology.

MTR assessment

PUB is monitoring leakages from the transmission main. PUB will provide latest data. Actual NRW monitoring across South Tarawa water supply zones will start only after commissioning of the new network.&nbsp;

