The indicator relates to sustainable management plans for the water reserves of Bonriki and Buota, to be prepared and implemented under the project to mitigate pollution risks. It describes whether at least one plan has been approved and is being implemented

MTR assessment

At the MTR mission, the PMU proposed to have improved monitoring systems for monitoring of quantity. Tracking of salinity was happening earlier through PUB, but now stopped. There is also lack of clarity on regulation of water quality and use. Therefore, the plan for water reserve management has to cover multiple aspects beyond just monitoring, suh as stakeholder engagement;&nbsp;policy, institutions and regulations; strengthened monitoring and knowledge; capacity building etc. PMU is currently not able to focus on this activity. Hence PMU will hire additional staff to handle this aspect. Once the staff is hired, the WB will provide necessary technical assistance.&nbsp;

CSI

This indicator is aligned with the CSI:&nbsp;Millions of hectares of terrestrial and aquatic areas under enhanced conservation and management&nbsp;

