This indicator describes whether the private operator, to be recruited under Design-Build-Operate arrangements, is contracted and supporting technically PUB in the operation of its water systems.

MTR assessment

Since the approach to have private operator support through a works plus O&amp;M contract was unsuccessful, a revised approach will be formulated based on a workshop planned in July 2024. The indicator will be revised based on the new approach decided.&nbsp;

